[0.122041, "o", "\u001b[1mvibe-rescue scan\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m/tmp/vibe-scan-p41ik3zf\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mleaked-secrets\u001b[22m  \u001b[33mfound\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2msrc/main.tsx:5\u001b[22m\r\n     Hardcoded service role jwt in client file src/main.tsx.\r\n\u001b[2m     Move it to SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY in a gitignored .env file and rotate it.\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2m.env\u001b[22m\r\n     .env is not gitignored and can be committed with secrets.\r\n\u001b[2m     Add it to .gitignore. If git already tracks it, run git rm --cached .env and rotate the keys.\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mimport-paths\u001b[22m  \u001b[33mfound\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2msrc/main.tsx\u001b[22m\r\n     src/main.tsx imports date-fns, which is not in package.json.\r\n\u001b[2m     date-fns will be added with version *. Run npm install afterwards.\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2msrc/main.tsx\u001b[22m\r\n     src/main.tsx imports ./components/button, but the path on disk is ./components/Button.\r\n\u001b[2m     The specifier will be rewritten to the casing that exists on disk.\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mhardcoded-localhost\u001b[22m  \u001b[33mfound\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2msrc/main.tsx:6\u001b[22m\r\n     Hardcoded http://localhost:3000 in src/main.tsx.\r\n\u001b[2m     Use import.meta.env.VITE_API_BASE_URL. VITE_API_BASE_URL will be added to .env.example.\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mspa-rewrites\u001b[22m  \u001b[33mfound\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2mvercel.json\u001b[22m\r\n     vercel.json has no SPA rewrite to /index.html.\r\n\u001b[2m     A rewrite to /index.html will be added. Nothing is deployed.\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2mnetlify.toml\u001b[22m\r\n     Netlify redirect from /* to /index.html (200) is missing.\r\n\u001b[2m     A rewrite to /index.html will be added. Nothing is deployed.\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2mpublic/_redirects\u001b[22m\r\n     Static host _redirects rule /* /index.html 200 is missing.\r\n\u001b[2m     A rewrite to /index.html will be added. Nothing is deployed.\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1msupabase-rls\u001b[22m  \u001b[33mfound\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2msupabase/migrations/20240101000000_init.sql\u001b[22m\r\n     Table public.notes is created without ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY.\r\n\u001b[2m     A new migration will enable RLS and add a deny-all policy for anon and authenticated. No database is contacted.\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mwebhook-signature\u001b[22m  \u001b[33mfound\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2mserver/stripe-webhook.ts\u001b[22m\r\n     server/stripe-webhook.ts handles a Stripe webhook without constructEvent.\r\n\u001b[2m     A signature check will be inserted. Set STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET and send Stripe the raw body.\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mmissing-env\u001b[22m  \u001b[33mfound\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2mserver/stripe-webhook.ts:3\u001b[22m\r\n     STRIPE_SECRET_KEY is referenced in server/stripe-webhook.ts but missing from .env.example and .env.\r\n\u001b[2m     An .env.example entry and .vibe-rescue/check-env.mjs will be generated. Fill in the real value locally.\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2msrc/lib/config.ts:1\u001b[22m\r\n     API_TOKEN is referenced in src/lib/config.ts but missing from .env.example and .env.\r\n\u001b[2m     An .env.example entry and .vibe-rescue/check-env.mjs will be generated. Fill in the real value locally.\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2msrc/lib/config.ts:2\u001b[22m\r\n     VITE_SUPABASE_URL is referenced in src/lib/config.ts but missing from .env.example and .env.\r\n\u001b[2m     An .env.example entry and .vibe-rescue/check-env.mjs will be generated. Fill in the real value locally.\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m13 findings · 13 errors · 0 warnings\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n\u001b[2mvibe-rescue-kit by deepelynx\u001b[22m\r\n"]
